flowchart TD
  voice[Voice] --> stt[Speech recognition]
  text[Typed request] --> core[Wingman conversation and routing]
  stt --> core
  core --> waterfall[Unofficial optional Waterfall: main-provider route]
  waterfall --> main[Main model: reasoning and tool use]
  main --> tools[Skills and supported commands]
  tools -->|results| main
  main --> reply[Answer text]
  reply --> tts[Speech synthesis]
  core -. background work .-> support[Support: memory and summaries]
  tools -. explicit inexpensive work .-> support
  core -. enabled bounded choices .-> jev[Decision model: Jev]
  jev -. decision result .-> core
  waterfall -. optional per-route assistance .-> jev
  support --> memory[Memory and context]
  embedding[Embedding model: retrieval vectors] --> memory
  memory -. context .-> core
  screen[Game screenshot] --> vision[Image-capable main model]
  vision -->|observations| tools
